---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" lang="en" description="Privacy policy of Sun & Soul by Kiki.">
  <section class="py-8 md:py-14 lg:py-20 px-4">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl prose-warm">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl text-dark-brown italic mb-12 text-center">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <h2>1. Responsible party</h2>
      <p>
        Frederike Helders<br />
        Sun & Soul by Kiki<br />
        [Street and number]<br />
        [Postal code] Berlin<br />
        Email: hello@sunandsoulbykiki.de
      </p>

      <h2>2. Overview</h2>
      <p>This privacy policy informs you about the nature, scope, and purpose of the collection and use of personal data on this website in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>

      <h2>3. Hosting</h2>
      <p>This website is hosted by <strong>Netlify, Inc.</strong> (44 Montgomery Street, Suite 300, San Francisco, CA 94104, USA). When you visit this website, Netlify automatically collects technical information in server log files transmitted by your browser, including IP address, browser type and version, operating system, referrer URL, and time of the server request.</p>
      <p>This data is processed for the technical provision of the website. The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) lit. f GDPR (legitimate interest in a stable website). For data transfers to the USA, Netlify relies on EU Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>

      <h2>4. Fonts</h2>
      <p>This website uses fonts that are hosted locally on our own server. <strong>No connection to external servers</strong> (such as Google) takes place. No data is transmitted to third parties.</p>

      <h2>5. Contact form</h2>
      <p>When you use the contact form on this website, your information (name, email address, message) is processed via the service <strong>Web3Forms</strong> and forwarded to our email address. Web3Forms does not permanently store your data.</p>

      <h2>6. Appointment booking</h2>
      <p>For appointment booking, we use the service <strong>Cal.com</strong>. When you book an appointment, the data you enter (name, email, desired appointment) is processed by Cal.com. The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) lit. b GDPR.</p>

      <h2>7. External links</h2>
      <p>This website contains links to external services (e.g., Instagram). When clicking these links, data is transmitted to the respective provider.</p>

      <h2>8. Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>This website uses <strong>no cookies</strong> — neither tracking cookies nor technically necessary cookies. <strong>No analytics tools</strong> are used. Your browsing behavior is not recorded, analyzed, or shared with third parties. A cookie banner is therefore not required.</p>

      <h2>9. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal data: right of access (Art. 15 GDPR), right to rectification (Art. 16 GDPR), right to erasure (Art. 17 GDPR), right to restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR), right to data portability (Art. 20 GDPR), and right to object (Art. 21 GDPR).</p>
      <p>To exercise your rights, please contact us by email at: hello@sunandsoulbykiki.de</p>

      <h2>10. Last updated</h2>
      <p>March 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
